# CO-QA-003 — Enterprise Lender Registry Search

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Effective immediately  
Authority: CO-BUG-011 · CO-QA-001

## Rules

1. Strategy Manual Recommendation searches **Prisma Enterprise Lender Registry only** (`listCanonicalEnterpriseLenderOptionsAsync`).
2. Never swallow lender API failures as an empty list on the Manual / Deal-eligible path.
3. Auth refresh waiters must always be flushed (success **and** failure) — never leave “Searching Enterprise Lender Registry…” forever.
4. Soft Go-Live local catalog must not be used for Deal FK lender selection.

